calibration_complete.description:
Calibration for {device_name} complete!

Measured times:
- Open time: {open_time} seconds
- Close time: {close_time} seconds

These times are used to accurately track the shutter's position.

Status detection from calibration:
- Primary status identity: {primary_status_identity}
- Primary commands used: {primary_frames}
- Secondary identities: {secondary_status_identities}
- Observed frames: {observed_frame_count}
- End reason: {calibration_end_reason}
- Position tracking: {position_tracking}

If no receive/status identity was discovered, the shutter can still be controlled; its position will then be estimated based on the commands sent by Home Assistant.

